You are indeed being summoned to your quest.   As a samurai, I typically
find my quest summoning on level 12.  You are looking for a ^ trap, which
will teleport you to your quest level.

It's a good idea to get a few more experience levels before you get there,
on my quest, I defeated all the hostile ninjas, only to have Lord Sato tell 
me I wasn't experienced enough...come back later!  Needless to say, I left
and never made it back to receive my quest artifact (another glorious
nethack death).

I have never been on the elven quest before, but would advise taking along
a ring of conflict if you can, as I'd imagine it will come in handy.  

Good luck!

